obj_scribble.textbox(
	@"Gamby, you're not listening.
	[/page]The eighth house is loss. Endings.
	[/page]Things you can't take back.
	[/page]Saturn is restriction, Mars is accidents, violence, sudden stuff.
	[/page]When they line up like this, something horrible is bound to happen...
	", 
